<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that CapStar Hotel Corp, Ingram Micro Inc and Unisys Corp were unvailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unvailable were Corimon SACA and Diana Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
